        <name>GetRandomSession64</name>
        <briefdescription>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Generate a hardware-generated random 64-bit session number.</para>
<para><itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>bits 63..61 (3 bits): Engine index. (never 0, starts at 1)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>bit 60 (1 bit): Set to 0 to leave room for incrementing without rolling into the engine index.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>bits 59..24 (36 bits): Random part.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>bits 23..0 (24 bits): Birthday paradox prevention part, stays in range <ulink url="i.e. [1, 2^24 - 1]">1, 16777215</ulink>. <simplesect kind="return"><para>The random 64-bit session number. </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
        </detaileddescription>
